#ASSERT `the Registrar is to issue a notice of change of registered business name` (`Name Change Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT `the Registrar must refuse the change of registered business name` (`Name Change Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar must refuse the change of registered business name` (`Name Change Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)

§§ `19. Change of residential address`

-- Address Change Facts: kind of holder, date of change, report made under the National Registration Act.
`a registered individual proprietor moving on 1 March 2026` MEANS `Address Change Facts` OF `a registered individual proprietor`, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE
`a partner moving on 1 March 2026` MEANS `Address Change Facts` OF `a partner of a registered firm who is an individual`, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE
`an authorised representative moving on 1 March 2026` MEANS `Address Change Facts` OF `an authorised representative`, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE
`someone else moving` MEANS `Address Change Facts` OF `someone else`, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE
`a proprietor who reported the move under the National Registration Act` MEANS `Address Change Facts` OF `a registered individual proprietor`, YMD 2026 3 1, TRUE

#ASSERT `the individual must lodge a notice of the new residential address` `a registered individual proprietor moving on 1 March 2026`
#ASSERT `the individual must lodge a notice of the new residential address` `a partner moving on 1 March 2026`
#ASSERT `the individual must lodge a notice of the new residential address` `an authorised representative moving on 1 March 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `the individual must lodge a notice of the new residential address` `someone else moving`
#ASSERT `the last day for lodging the notice of the new residential address` `a registered individual proprietor moving on 1 March 2026` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 15
#ASSERT `the individual is taken to have informed the Registrar of the change of residential address` `a proprietor who reported the move under the National Registration Act`
#ASSERT NOT `the individual is taken to have informed the Registrar of the change of residential address` `a registered individual proprietor moving on 1 March 2026`

#TRACE `the duty to lodge a notice of the new residential address` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `The registrant` DOES `lodge a notice of the new residential address` AT 14

#TRACE `the duty to lodge a notice of the new residential address` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 15)

§§ `20. Registration of change in particulars`

-- Particulars Change Facts: kind of change, date of change, last day the Registrar allowed.
`a change of principal place of business on 1 March 2026` MEANS `Particulars Change Facts` OF `a change in any other registered particular`, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING
`a change of residential address` MEANS `Particulars Change Facts` OF `a change of the residential address of a registered individual proprietor, of a partner of a registered firm who is an individual, or of an authorised representative`, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING
`a change of registered business name` MEANS `Particulars Change Facts` OF `a change of a registered business name`, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING
`a change on 1 March 2026 with more time to 31 March` MEANS `Particulars Change Facts` OF `a change in any other registered particular`, YMD 2026 3 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 31)
`a change on 1 March 2026 with an allowance shorter than 14 days` MEANS `Particulars Change Facts` OF `a change in any other registered particular`, YMD 2026 3 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 5)

#ASSERT `section 20(1) applies to the change` `a change of principal place of business on 1 March 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `section 20(1) applies to the change` `a change of residential address`
#ASSERT NOT `section 20(1) applies to the change` `a change of registered business name`
#ASSERT `the last day for lodging the notice of the change in particulars` `a change of principal place of business on 1 March 2026` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 15
#ASSERT `the last day for lodging the notice of the change in particulars` `a change on 1 March 2026 with more time to 31 March` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 31
#ASSERT `the last day for lodging the notice of the change in particulars` `a change on 1 March 2026 with an allowance shorter than 14 days` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 15

#TRACE `the duty to lodge a notice of the change in particulars` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `The registrant` DOES `lodge a notice of the change in particulars` AT 14

#TRACE `the duty to lodge a notice of the change in particulars` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 15)

