§§ `22. Cessation of business`

-- Cessation Facts: stopped carrying on business, date stopped, date notice lodged, advance notice allowed,
-- date specified in the advance notice.
`stopped on 1 March 2026, notice lodged on the 14th day` MEANS `Cessation Facts` OF TRUE, YMD 2026 3 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 15), FALSE, NOTHING
`stopped on 1 March 2026, notice lodged on the 15th day` MEANS `Cessation Facts` OF TRUE, YMD 2026 3 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 16), FALSE, NOTHING
`stopped on 1 March 2026, no notice lodged` MEANS `Cessation Facts` OF TRUE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, NOTHING
`not stopped` MEANS `Cessation Facts` OF FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, NOTHING
`an advance notice for 30 April 2026` MEANS `Cessation Facts` OF TRUE, YMD 2026 4 30, JUST (YMD 2026 3 20), TRUE, JUST (YMD 2026 4 30)

#ASSERT `the last day for lodging the notice of cessation of business` `stopped on 1 March 2026, no notice lodged` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 15
#ASSERT NOT `the registered person is guilty of an offence under section 22(3)` `stopped on 1 March 2026, notice lodged on the 14th day`
#ASSERT `the registered person is guilty of an offence under section 22(3)` `stopped on 1 March 2026, notice lodged on the 15th day`
#ASSERT `the registered person is guilty of an offence under section 22(3)` `stopped on 1 March 2026, no notice lodged`
#ASSERT NOT `the registered person is guilty of an offence under section 22(3)` `not stopped`
#ASSERT `the registered person may lodge a notice in advance` `an advance notice for 30 April 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `the registered person may lodge a notice in advance` `stopped on 1 March 2026, no notice lodged`
#ASSERT `the date the registration ceases` `an advance notice for 30 April 2026` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 4 30)
#ASSERT `the date the registration ceases` `stopped on 1 March 2026, notice lodged on the 14th day` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 3 15)
#ASSERT `the date the registration ceases` `stopped on 1 March 2026, no notice lodged` EQUALS NOTHING

